<text><body>
<div type="detail"><p>Donaldson Lane is located between Swanston Street and Russell Street, between Little Bourke Street and Bourke Street. Prior to 1950, Donaldson Lane was known as Cyclorama Lane, due to its location near the Cyclorama in Little Collins Street (now Georges Apartments).</p></div>
